1
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,480
Just nonsense.

2
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,039
Nezha once said,

3
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,760
"My destine is determined by me, not by heaven."

4
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:19,440
Don't worry.

5
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:20,879
I know what I'm doing.

6
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,800
We'll be fine.

7
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:26,839
I'm here.

8
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,079
This child...

9
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:36,799
What's wrong?

10
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:37,719
Gu Jiachen.

11
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:39,320
If I'm not wrong,

12
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,280
this man should be a human trafficker.

13
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:02,439
Come on.

14
00:02:02,439 --> 00:02:03,200
Cheers.

15
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,280
Drink it up.

16
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,000
Come on, keep drinking.

17
00:02:15,159 --> 00:02:15,639
Drink.

18
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,199
What are you doing? Raising fish?

19
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:18,960
Drink it up.

20
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,319
Drink.

21
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:21,639
Hurry up.

22
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,080
Fill it up.

23
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:37,000
Bro,

24
00:02:37,719 --> 00:02:38,759
please let me go.

25
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:39,879
How much do you want?

26
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:40,520
I'll give you everything I have.

27
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,360
There's actually

28
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,919
such a bold criminal den here.

29
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,000
You bunch of scoundrels!

30
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:52,919
Stay here.

31
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,639
Don't come out

32
00:02:55,199 --> 00:02:55,800
until it's all over.

33
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:57,800
Trust me.

34
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:04,520
Come out!

35
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,280
Who are you?

36
00:03:13,039 --> 00:03:13,879
I'm here to

37
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:15,919
bring you to justice.

38
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:19,159
Anyone can be a hero

39
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:20,599
these days.

40
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,360
One last night,

41
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,400
and another today.

42
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,639
Looks like

43
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:28,120
you need to taste blood

44
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:29,840
to know my strength.

45
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,159
Get them!

46
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:00,599
Gu Jiachen,

47
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:02,759
your skills are nothing special.

48
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:04,560
I should have come earlier.

49
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,520
Stop!

50
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,560
Ye Xuan!

51
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,439
Kill them all.

52
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:51,560
You should leave one alive

53
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,040
for interrogation.

54
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:52,959
We don't know

55
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:53,759
where they were taken.

56
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,639
How can we save the others?

57
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,959
You're ordering me around now?

58
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,399
Go save them!

59
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,160
Kid,

60
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:25,560
what do you want from me?

61
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,319
Thank you.

62
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,639
Brother.

63
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,120
Brother,

64
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,920
there's someone hiding over there.

65
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:03,279
Brother, I don't eat scallions.

66
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,000
Cut the crap.

67
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,040
Eat it.

68
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:19,680
[Ye Xuan,]

69
00:06:20,759 --> 00:06:23,519
[did Your Highness possess you?]

70
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,160
[Why are you so easygoing?]

71
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:29,879
Slow down.

72
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,319
You're like a starving ghost.

73
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:36,480
Finally, you've met a woman

74
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,720
you can't handle.

75
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:42,079
You're the first.

76
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:46,600
Keep an eye on her.

77
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:49,399
Don't lose her again.

78
00:06:50,439 --> 00:06:51,120
I'll never forget

79
00:06:51,879 --> 00:06:53,199
your great kindness.

80
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:53,639
Thank you.

81
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,319
Brother,

82
00:06:58,639 --> 00:07:00,839
will we meet again?

83
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:05,839
Look.

84
00:07:09,639 --> 00:07:10,079
Let's go.

85
00:07:10,959 --> 00:07:11,439
Where are we going?

86
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,360
The human trafficker has already

87
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,560
exposed the delivery location.

88
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:16,560
I'm going to save people with you.

89
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,199
How do I look?

90
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:31,519
I'm pretty, right?

91
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:34,839
What are you laughing at?

92
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,079
You are pretty.

93
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,480
If you had told me you were going to dress like this,

94
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,120
I would have come to see the joke.

95
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,720
I would also help you save people.

96
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:42,319
Ye Xuan.

97
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,040
Forget it.

98
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,360
I won't argue with a little boy like you.

99
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,759
Are you cursing me?

100
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:52,399
I said you look good when you smile.

101
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:54,319
Don't be so aggressive every day,

102
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:55,480
which makes people afraid to get close to you.

103
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:57,879
Am I

104
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,199
like a human trafficker?

105
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,279
Are you a human?

106
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:07,600
All right, all right.

107
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,519
It's time to get to work.

108
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,639
According to the original plan,

109
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,839
Shen Li pretends to be a human trafficker,

110
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:12,920
and takes me,

111
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:14,839
the innocent girl who was kidnapped,

112
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:15,560
to deliver the goods.

113
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:16,800
Then we'll sneak

114
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,879
into their lair

115
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,959
and take them all down.

116
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:21,319
Don't follow too closely later.

117
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:21,879
It'll give us away.

118
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,879
You don't need to tell me that.

119
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:24,920
Right.

120
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,680
You're a pro at this.

121
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:28,959
I shouldn't worry.

122
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,480
I should be worried

123
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,160
about myself.

124
00:08:31,759 --> 00:08:32,440
No need.

125
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:34,440
I'll protect you.

126
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:38,279
Someone's coming.

127
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,120
Hide.

128
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:44,799
So handsome.

129
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,960
I've never seen you before.

130
00:08:57,519 --> 00:08:58,279
Are you new here?

131
00:08:59,639 --> 00:09:01,159
The capital has been poorly defended

132
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,200
recently.

133
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:06,240
My brothers are all out on business,

134
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:08,360
and they don't dare to delay your business.

135
00:09:09,039 --> 00:09:10,879
So they sent me here.

136
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:13,759
Although there's only one person this time,

137
00:09:14,519 --> 00:09:16,679
he looks pretty good.

138
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:19,120
He's quite handsome.

139
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,399
It's just that the way he's dressed

140
00:09:22,519 --> 00:09:23,360
is a bit lacking.

141
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:33,120
Why don't you go? What are you waiting for?

142
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,840
I don't want to delay your journey.

143
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:39,279
But how about I help you to the end

144
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:41,960
and take her to you?

145
00:09:42,759 --> 00:09:43,600
Before you came out,

146
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:46,679
didn't your brother tell you the rules?

147
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:49,039
You should leave after finishing the job.

148
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,679
If you keep pestering us,

149
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:55,639
you must be a spy sent by the government.

150
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,000
If I were a spy,

151
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,759
how could I come alone

152
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:01,799
with a beauty?

153
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,879
I just think you're pretty.

154
00:10:06,039 --> 00:10:07,080
I won't look at her.

155
00:10:07,639 --> 00:10:09,440
Before you take her away,

156
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:14,120
You wish!

157
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,399
Take her away!

158
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,480
Go, go!

159
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:47,679
Bring her down.

160
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,039
Intoxicated by Spring Breeze.

161
00:11:02,639 --> 00:11:03,080
Take her inside.

162
00:11:03,559 --> 00:11:03,879
Let's go.

163
00:11:19,399 --> 00:11:20,440
Take care of my horse.

164
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,600
If it gets hurt,

165
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,440
I'll break your fingers.

166
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,159
Yes.

167
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:31,679
Mr. Fu Yi,

168
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,480
what brings you here today?

169
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,240
As usual,

170
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:37,000
we've reserved a room for you.

171
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:39,759
Sir,

172
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,360
why are you so quiet today?

173
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:43,639
I'm tired.

174
00:11:44,399 --> 00:11:45,000
OK.

175
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:47,120
Then take a rest.

176
00:11:47,639 --> 00:11:48,799
I'll arrange a girl for you.

177
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:49,679
Lead the way.

178
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:50,200
OK.

179
00:12:22,559 --> 00:12:23,519
Where is this place?

180
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,600
It's so dark.

181
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:38,240
Good thing I was prepared.

182
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:39,240
Yexuan,

183
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,120
I'm waiting for you.

184
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:41,960
Mr. Fu Yi,

185
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:44,879
these girls are all new.

186
00:12:45,559 --> 00:12:47,720
See if there's anyone you like.

187
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:50,919
Ordinary and vulgar.

188
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:55,000
I'll get you a new batch.

189
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:56,879
Forget it.

190
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:58,879
You all go out.

191
00:12:59,679 --> 00:13:00,840
I want to be alone.

192
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,000
Go out.

193
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,320
Did I just stumble upon

194
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,559
some dark cult ritual?

195
00:13:48,279 --> 00:13:49,200
What's going on here?

196
00:14:08,679 --> 00:14:09,480
Pigment

197
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,000
After all these years

198
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,840
Still the same old tricks

199
00:14:15,799 --> 00:14:16,320
What are you doing

200
00:14:21,879 --> 00:14:22,559
Young Master Fuyi

201
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:23,840
This is the back courtyard

202
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:24,919
You cannot enter

203
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,000
I, this young master

204
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:33,440
Would I stoop to fight you

205
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,399
Why waste more words

206
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,279
Do you really think I'm Fuyi

207
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,480
That weakling who can't even lift a finger

208
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,519
Can you hear me?

209
00:15:08,399 --> 00:15:09,480
I'm here to save you.

210
00:15:16,919 --> 00:15:17,679
Long time no see,

211
00:15:20,399 --> 00:15:21,159
Holy Maiden.

212
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,759
I didn't expect you to be alive.

213
00:15:26,919 --> 00:15:27,679
Holy Maiden?
